nd romance spanning over 30 years<br></li><li>Three different playable characters: Jack the outsider, Aliena the noblewoman and Philip the monk<br></li><li>Brings the 12th century to life with over 200 handpainted backgrounds<br></li><li>Fully animated in a unique 2D style<br></li><li>Optimized for use with controller and mouse<br></li><li>Orchestral Soundtrack by the FILMharmonic Orchestra, Prague<br></li><li>Full voice over in English and German, featuring Glen McCready as Philip, Naomi Sheldon as Aliena and Cody Molko and Alex Jordan as the young and adult Jack<br></li><li>With a special appearance by Ken Follett as the voice of the Cantor</li></ul>",
